      "evidence": "userB1c§2; inheritedflowreferences",
      "2D 역이식 후보": "예",
      "dependenciesFor2D": "Manual bleeding-source/lesion union+CO adapter and ratio-anatomy layer; new compatibility identifiers not existing2Ddeclarations"
    },
    {
      "id": "natural_closure",
      "classification": "원본+튜닝",
      "rule": "기존.10/180s유지. 합친기본severity≤.10일때각lesion이180s지수감소. .10초과는중지. 이전에닫힌lesion은새피격으로재개방하지않음. 유효union으로출혈/상처별가중배분.",
      "evidence": "v44hemostasisthresholds;aggregationtuning",
      "2D 역이식 후보": "예",
      "dependenciesFor2D": "Manual bleeding-source/lesion union+CO adapter and ratio-anatomy layer; new compatibility identifiers not existing2Ddeclarations"
    },
    {
      "id": "other_organ_beds",
      "classification": "버그수정/튜닝",
      "rule": "B1부터장기별ID공유는있었으나8mm²×severity면적단순합산. 이제각닫힌lesionseverity의union×8mm², 기존정맥압/45s노출/1.7지역cap보존, 현재가정관류.20CO도상한. 실제장기도형lung2/heart/bowel, stomach/bladder처리코드는있지만도형은없음.",
      "evidence": "medical-b1 originalbed; B1c§1",
      "2D 역이식 후보": "예",
      "dependenciesFor2D": "Manual bleeding-source/lesion union+CO adapter and ratio-anatomy layer; new compatibility identifiers not existing2Ddeclarations"
    },
    {
      "id": "hepatic_portal_shapes",
      "classification": "출처+튜닝",
      "rule": "기존75무관도형원문+기존IVC원래경로접두보존하고hepatic-vein-trunk/portal-vein만추가. abdomen/spine소유비율캡슐사슬,각기본지름9.45mm(해부학대표참고+게임피팅). 간정맥하위3개를대표줄기로근사.",
