      "dependenciesFor2D": "Manual bleeding-source/lesion union+CO adapter and ratio-anatomy layer; new compatibility identifiers not existing2Ddeclarations"
    },
    {
      "id": "retrohepatic_ivc",
      "classification": "원본/검사",
      "rule": "체형1.1검사에서원래IVC의간상단투영일부미포함확인. 기존abdominal-vena-cava에정규화상단.85→.97구간추가. 기존12segments/지름/경로는그대로,새12segments는동일R1피팅. 같은ID/출혈원1개유지,중복IVC없음.원래retroperitoneal분류상속.",
